Dhyuthi 7.0 — Official Website DocumentationTechnical and operational documentation for the Dhyuthi 7.0 landing page, the flagship technical festival hosted by the IEEE SCT Student Branch.1. Project OverviewThe Dhyuthi 7.0 web client is a single-page landing site designed with a dark, high-contrast, cyberpunk/cinematic aesthetic. The site manages event lifecycles across four phases:Track reveals (academic/competition domains)Pre-events (workshops, community mixers, teasers)Main competitions (hackathons, sprint challenges)Winner announcements & schedules (staged releases via visual status locks)2. System Architecture & Tech StackLayerTechnologyPurposeFrameworkTanStack Start (v1)SSR-ready, full-stack routing framework built on TanStack RouterUI LibraryReact 19 + TypeScriptComponent tree and static typingStylingTailwind CSS v4Utility-first styling with modern native CSS variable supportPrimitivesshadcn/ui (Button)Accessible base button componentsIconsLucide ReactClean, scalable vector interface iconsTypographyArchivo & Space GroteskDisplay headers and technical body typography via Google FontsRuntime / PMBunFast dependency management and local development runtime3. Directory LayoutPlaintext.
