7. Migration & Deployment NotesLogo Reference ResolutionThe code contains platform-specific asset bindings depending on your host:When building on Lovable: Keep the asset descriptor import:TypeScriptimport logo from "@/assets/SB_White_1.png.asset.json";
// Applied as: <img src={logo.url} alt="IEEE SCT SB" />
When deploying to Vercel, Netlify, or standard SSR hosting: Switch to the public direct path to prevent build errors:TypeScriptconst logo = "/logo.png";
